source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-22
observed: Jira substitutes an en dash for a space-surrounded double hyphen; jiro treats dash substitution in code as Jira misrendering and stays silent.
